{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>隨著新款 iPad mini 推出，Apple 現行 iPad 陣容中的每一款型號均已配備橫向前置相機。這項轉變由 2022 年的第 10 代 iPad 開始，其後在 2024 年擴展至 M2 iPad Air 及 M4 iPad Pro。</p>\n<h2>iPad mini 最後完成過渡</h2>\n<p>iPad mini 是整個陣容中最後一款仍把前置相機置於直向邊緣的型號。新款 iPad mini 把 1,200 萬像素 Center Stage 相機移至橫向邊緣，讓用戶橫向手持裝置進行視像通話時，可獲得較自然的視角。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 iPad mini 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"628\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/ipadmini-1.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:41:07.424071+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":248,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:32:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:22.985585+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:38:26.733231+00:00","content_hash":"5676538e5613eae4341f5a652ce0f9ef75688378bc6c27edaddae6e05998c6e7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:41:07.424071+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}